<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6498" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-ζεύγνῡμι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-ζευγνύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>yoke</i> or <i>harness again,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναζευγνύναι τὸν στρατόν</span>
			<i>move off</i> the army, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.41
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸ στρατόπεδον</span>
			<i>break up</i> the camp, ib.<i><span class="en">
				58
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς τὸν Ἰσθμὸν τὰς νῆας</span>
			<i>withdraw</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				8.60
			</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>break up, shift
				one's quarters,</i> mostly in part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοζεύξας ἤλαυνε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.108
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.4.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				103.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐκ τῆς Ἀραβίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. διὰ Συρίας</span>
			<i>march through</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				84
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὰς πράξεις</span>
			<u>Chron.Lind.</u><i><span class="en">
				D.
				43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>repel,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕβριν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Cos</u>
				350
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
